{
    "title": "Mirror - Fullscreen Mirror App",
    "description": "Check your look on the go with Mirror. Stop trying different mirror apps, this is the app you were looking for. It's a simple and lightweight mirror app with all the features you need.\r\n\r\n<b>What makes Mirror better than other mirror apps?</b>\r\n\u2022 <b>360 \u00ba mirror</b>. Unique feature to record yourself from different angles.\r\n\u2022 <b>Lighting frame</b>. Perfect for low light situations, see yourself even in total darkness.\r\n\u2022 <b>Zoom and exposure</b> gesture controls. Quick and easy adjustments.\r\n\u2022 <b>Freeze image</b> to avoid taking unnecessary pictures.\r\n\u2022 <b>Share or save</b> your best selfies and video selfies.\r\n\u2022 <b>Super clear image</b>\r\n\u2022 <b>Quick settings tile</b> to open the mirror quickly.\r\n\r\n<b>Why is Mirror better than just using the camera?</b>\r\n\u2714 Better visibility\r\n\u2714 No need to change between front and back camera\r\n\u2714 Lighting frame for low light situations\r\n\u2714 Freeze image without having to take a picture\r\n\u2714 One finger gesture to control zoom and exposure\r\n\u2714 360\u00ba Mirror, which makes this even better than a real Mirror\r\n\r\nWe care about our users, we focus on providing the best user experience. Mirror will show you how a well-thought app can make the difference.\r\n\r\nWe work hard to make our users happy. If you have any suggestions or you are having any problem with Mirror please don't hesitate to contact us.\r\n\r\nGood app reviews help to get to more people and to keep working on the apps. If you find this app useful, <b>please show us some love in the play store!</b> \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\r\n\r\n<b>Don't forget to try the 360\u00ba Mirror functionality.</b>\r\nTap start and turn your head to both sides (or move the device around you), to see yourself from different angles. Much better than a simple mirror.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Check your look on the go with Mirror. Stop trying different mirror apps, this is the app you were looking for. It&#39;s a simple and lightweight mirror app with all the features you need.<br><br><b>What makes Mirror better than other mirror apps?</b><br>\u2022 <b>360 \u00ba mirror</b>. Unique feature to record yourself from different angles.<br>\u2022 <b>Lighting frame</b>. Perfect for low light situations, see yourself even in total darkness.<br>\u2022 <b>Zoom and exposure</b> gesture controls. Quick and easy adjustments.<br>\u2022 <b>Freeze image</b> to avoid taking unnecessary pictures.<br>\u2022 <b>Share or save</b> your best selfies and video selfies.<br>\u2022 <b>Super clear image</b><br>\u2022 <b>Quick settings tile</b> to open the mirror quickly.<br><br><b>Why is Mirror better than just using the camera?</b><br>\u2714 Better visibility<br>\u2714 No need to change between front and back camera<br>\u2714 Lighting frame for low light situations<br>\u2714 Freeze image without having to take a picture<br>\u2714 One finger gesture to control zoom and exposure<br>\u2714 360\u00ba Mirror, which makes this even better than a real Mirror<br><br>We care about our users, we focus on providing the best user experience. Mirror will show you how a well-thought app can make the difference.<br><br>We work hard to make our users happy. If you have any suggestions or you are having any problem with Mirror please don&#39;t hesitate to contact us.<br><br>Good app reviews help to get to more people and to keep working on the apps. If you find this app useful, <b>please show us some love in the play store!</b> \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50<br><br><b>Don&#39;t forget to try the 360\u00ba Mirror functionality.</b><br>Tap start and turn your head to both sides (or move the device around you), to see yourself from different angles. Much better than a simple mirror.",
